    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG304 · Assessment 1/4</span>\n<h2>Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13430 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG304 · Đầu điểm 1/4</span>\n<h2>Assignment 1</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13430 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">24 slots</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO5, CLO6, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Project</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Apply the principles of digital animation and motion graphics to carry out the pre-production stage, with the goal of creating a product that demonstrates harmony between visuals and sound.<br>Develop ideas and develop a concept for the product by completing all essential steps of pre-production, including: idea summary, moodboard, script or shot list, storyboard, character/background/font design (if applicable), and animatic.<br>The use of artificial intelligence (AI) tools during the pre-production stage is encouraged to support idea development.<br><br>Submission requirements:<br>A presentation slide summarizing all pre-production steps<br>Notes on how AI was applied (if applicable)<br>An animatic video (MP4, H.264)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">outcome based</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Idea: 1 point<br>Content: 2 point<br>Visuals: 2 point<br>Technique: 2 point<br>Creativity &amp; Personal Signature: 2 point<br>Awareness &amp; Professional Attitude: 1 point</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 25 — 1- Assignment 1: Presentation</li><li>Session 26 — Assignment 1: Presentation</li><li>Session 27 — Assignment 1: Presentation</li><li>Session 47 — Assignment 2:</li><li>Session 48 — Assignment 2:</li><li>Session 55 — Assignment 3: Final Presentation</li><li>Session 56 — Assignment 3: Final Presentation</li><li>Session 57 — Assignment 3: Final Presentation</li><li>Session 58 — Assignment 3: Final Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 25 — 1- Assignment 1: Presentation</li><li>Buổi 26 — Assignment 1: Presentation</li><li>Buổi 27 — Assignment 1: Presentation</li><li>Buổi 47 — Assignment 2:</li><li>Buổi 48 — Assignment 2:</li><li>Buổi 55 — Assignment 3: Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 56 — Assignment 3: Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 57 — Assignment 3: Final Presentation</li><li>Buổi 58 — Assignment 3: Final Presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
